# Descriptor: [anti-B0 -> D_0*+ l- nu, D_0*+ -> D+ eta] gap mode (resonant S-wave)
# NickName: B0_D0stlnu_Deta_gapmodes
# Documentation: Gap mode; D_0*(2300)+ -> D+ eta S-wave component, isospin partner of
#   decfiles/gap_modes/Bplus/D0stDeta (D_0*0 -> D0 eta; arXiv:2605.03021, Eq. 38). Generated by
#   the full-isospin generalization of the SEM/Hausdorff pipeline. Note: unlike the Bplus file
#   (which aliases to the anti-D_0*0/anti-D0 labeling for its B-sig-primary convention), this B0
#   mirror uses the plain-doublet D_0*+/D+ labeling to keep the anti-B0sig primary line charge
#   +1 -- purely a bookkeeping choice (the generic LLSW/PHSP model is charge-conjugation
#   symmetric so this does not change the generated kinematics), consistent with the other new
#   B0 gap-mode decfiles in this generalization (D2stDeta, Dp1DstEta, Dp1Deta).
#   LLSW for B -> D_0* l nu; PHSP for scalar -> pseudoscalar + pseudoscalar sub-decay.
# Responsible: Philipp Horak
# Email: phorak@uvic.ca
# Date: 20260831

Alias D0steta0sig D_0*+
Alias anti-D0steta0sig D_0*-
ChargeConj D0steta0sig anti-D0steta0sig

Decay Upsilon(4S)
1.0 B0sig anti-B0sig  VSS_BMIX dm;
Enddecay

Decay anti-B0sig
0.500 D0steta0sig  e-  anti-nu_e  PHOTOS LLSW 0.68 -0.2 0.3;
0.500 D0steta0sig  mu- anti-nu_mu PHOTOS LLSW 0.68 -0.2 0.3;
Enddecay
CDecay B0sig

Decay D0steta0sig
1.0   D+  eta   PHSP;
Enddecay
CDecay anti-D0steta0sig

End
